{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12235010","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12235010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1223501001:1":{"text":"오셨군요...","source_cn":"你来了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1EB9FB203447F4C7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"오셨군요...","female":"오셨군요...","variant_male_record_index":"140332","variant_female_record_index":"140333","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223501002:1":{"text":"헤엑?! 온몸이 상처잖아요! 어쩌다... 괜찮아요?","source_cn":"你怎么浑身是伤，没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x778D3669E537370E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223501003:1":{"text":"레나타를 만나러 갔을 때 블러디 로즈에게 당했다고 하려고요.","source_cn":"我寻思见雷纳塔时候，就说被血薇帮打了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345AE9FB1DB0B260","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223501004:1":{"text":"그녀는 의심이 많아서 상처를 봐야 그 말을 믿을 거예요.","source_cn":"她性子多疑，看到我身上的伤，才会相信我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8D7CA67427C48D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223501005:1":{"text":"정말 심하네요. 누가 때린 거죠?","source_cn":"也真敢下手啊，谁打的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x674E4B7DCF8EA4AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223501006:1":{"text":"파스와 솔로가요. 사실 둘은 예전부터 저를 때리고 싶었을지도 몰라요. 정말 실감 나지 않나요? 하하!","source_cn":"帕斯和梭罗，可能他俩早就想打我了，打的很真哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79BF0085C47D41E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1223501006":{"text":"파스와 솔로가요. 사실 둘은 예전부터 저를 때리고 싶었을지도 몰라요. 정말 실감 나지 않나요? 하하!","source_cn":"帕斯和梭罗，可能他俩早就想打我了，打的很真哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79BF0085C47D41E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1223501007:0":{"text":"정말 세게 맞은 거 같네요...","source_cn":"看来打得真的很重……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B0B9A6149521142","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1223501008:1":{"text":"그건 중요하지 않아요. 중요한 건 레나타가 저를 믿는 거죠. 그녀와는 애쉬 베이에서 만나기로 했습니다.","source_cn":"这不重要，重要的是让雷纳塔相信我，我和她约了在灰烬湾见面。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDE53AD60F7B379F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1223501009:1":{"text":"하지만... 물귀신파에는 불문율이 있다는 것 알고 계시지요?","source_cn":"但……水鬼帮有个不成文的规矩，你们也知道吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EA4E96D733BB09F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1223501009":{"text":"하지만... 물귀신파에는 불문율이 있다는 것 알고 계시지요?","source_cn":"但……水鬼帮有个不成文的规矩，你们也知道吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EA4E96D733BB09F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1223501010:1":{"text":"맞습니다. 등대에서 저희 본거지를 뒤질 때 아마 보셨을 겁니다.","source_cn":"对对对，你们去瞭望角抄我们家的时候，应该见识过。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2C371A2219CF332E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"맞습니다. 등대에서 저희 본거지를 뒤질 때 아마 보셨을 겁니다.","female":"맞습니다. 등대에서 저희 본거지를 뒤질 때 아마 보셨을 겁니다.","variant_male_record_index":"140342","variant_female_record_index":"140343","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1223501011:1":{"text":"까놓고 말해서, 뇌물입니다.","source_cn":"说白了就是贿赂。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC2C1CF9D024316D9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"까놓고 말해서, 뇌물입니다.","female":"까놓고 말해서, 뇌물입니다.","variant_male_record_index":"140344","variant_female_record_index":"140345","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1223501014:1":{"text":"뇌물로 뭘 줘야 하나요? 물고기? 아니면 돈?","source_cn":"那要上贡什么东西呢？鱼？还是钱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1F25DD5EF9F7B0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1223501015:1":{"text":"이번에는 적어도 페르세포네 정도는 줘야 할 겁니다. 파스에게 준비하라고 시켰어요.","source_cn":"最次也要冥湾美人，我准备让帕斯去钓。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD24EF86583FAE1F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_fe